Fiber 20KM</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"698\" class=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"234\">OTECH 10G SFP+ LR Module</strong> is a high-performance optical transceiver designed for <strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"324\">long-range 10 Gigabit Ethernet</strong> applications. Operating at a wavelength of <strong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"378\">1310nm</strong>, this SFP+ module delivers stable and high-speed data transmission over <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"478\">single-mode fiber (SMF)</strong> with distances up to <strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"517\">20 kilometers</strong>. Equipped with an <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"559\">LC duplex connector</strong> and a <strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"600\">hot-pluggable SFP+ form factor</strong>, it's the ideal solution for data centers, enterprise backbones, and ISP network infrastructures.</p>\n<p data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Data Rate: 10Gbps (10G Ethernet)</span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Wavelength: 1310nm (Long Range - LR)<br></span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Connector Type: LC Duplex<br></span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Fiber Type: Single-Mode (SMF)<br></span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Transmission Distance: Up to 20KM<br></span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Standard: 10GBASE-LR, IEEE 802.3ae compliant<br></span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Hot-swappable SFP+ form factor<br></span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Low power consumption and high reliability<br></span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">Made in China<br></span></li><li><span data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"717\">1-Year (Replacement Warranty)</span></li></ul><p data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1213\" class=\"\">Deliver reliable, high-speed, long-distance fiber connectivity with the <strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1121\">OTECH 10G SFP+ 1310nm LR Module</strong>, fully compatible with a wide range of SFP+ enabled switches, routers, and network devices.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module","href":"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module","now":"700৳","old":"800৳","single":""},{"name":"Huawei 10G SFP+ Module 850nm (Multi Mode) 0.3km","href":"/huawei-10g-sfp-module-850nm-multi-mode-03km","now":"1,200৳","old":"1,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SFP+SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ 850nm 300m SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sfpsr-10gbase-sr-sfp-850nm-300m-sfp-module","now":"5,500৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-module-10gbase-sr-optical-transceiver","now":"2,500৳","old":"3,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba 40G QSFP+ LC BiDi 150m MMF SFP Module","href":"/hpe-aruba-40g-qsfp-lc-bidi-150m-mmf-sfp-module","now":"7,000৳","old":"8,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco 40GBASE QSFP-40G-LR4-S 1310nm Single-Mode Duplex SMF LC 10KM SFP Module","href":"/cisco-40gbase-qsfp-40g-lr4-s-1310nm-single-mode-duplex-smf-lc-10km-sfp-module","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SX 1000BASE-SX 850nm 550m MMF SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sx-1000base-sx-850nm-550m-mmf-sfp-module","now":"3,000৳","old":"3,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Finisar 1000 BASE-T Copper RJ45 SFP Module 100m","href":"/finisar-1000-base-t-copper-rj45-sfp-module-100m","now":"1,100৳","old":"1,200৳","single":""},{"name":"HUAWEI 02310MNW 10GBASE-USR SFP+ 850nm 0.1km Multimode Transceiver Module","href":"/huawei-02310mnw-10gbase-usr-sfp-850nm-01km-multimode-transceiver-modul